  "title": "How to turn a growth audit into a 90-day plan | Fyntix",
  "description": "Turn an audit into a focused sequence of search, advertising and content improvements that a team can actually deliver.",
  "classes": "page-shell w-full relative min-h-screen pointer-events-auto",
